Reference quirk. metadata.xml says the `lemma` value is missing its
quotes, and the USX shows the whole attribute list read as text with the
quotes gone from `lemma`; but origin.usfm as checked in has
`lemma="ആകാശം"` with quotes, so the USX was generated from a different
input. The input on disk is a valid attribute list and the parser reads it
as one. The space before `|` stays in the word (rule 5 on `Text`).

